    categories: Main Meals:

-   Jollof Rice
-   Amala
-   Yam Porridge
-   Ewa Agoyin

Snacks: - Pie - Donut - Popcorn

Drinks: - Yogurt - Zobo

Include an “And Much More…” message to preserve the flyer’s promise of
