Each card should include: - Relevant, high-quality food image. - Exact
product name. - A short, neutral description only where it can be
written without inventing specific ingredients or claims. - An “Add to
Order” or “Select Item” button.

Do not display invented prices. If the customer needs a price, direct
them to confirm it through WhatsApp.

4.  SIMPLE INTERACTIVE ORDER SELECTION Make the menu usable, not just
    decorative.

-   Clicking “Add to Order” adds that menu item to a client-side order
