-   Allow customers to increase or decrease item quantities.
-   Allow customers to remove selected items.
-   Show the selected items and quantities in a compact order summary
    panel, drawer or modal.
-   Show a clear empty state when no items have been selected.
-   Do not calculate a monetary total because the flyer does not provide
    prices.
-   Include a notes field for special requests, with a reminder that
    availability and requests must be confirmed by CODE-8.
-   Provide a “Continue on WhatsApp” button.

When the customer chooses to continue, generate a WhatsApp click-to-chat
link addressed to +2348069489508. Pre-fill a neatly formatted message
containing the selected menu items, quantities, customer name if
entered, pickup or delivery preference, delivery address if applicable,
and optional notes.

The customer must review and send the WhatsApp message themselves. Do
not claim that the message has been sent automatically.

5.  BRAND PROMISES / ABOUT SECTION Create a visually engaging section
