8.  FOOTER Include:

-   CODE-8 wordmark.
-   “Good Food, Great Vibes.”
-   “Our Code-Ate.”
-   Phone / WhatsApp number.
-   Business address.
-   Quick links that scroll to sections on the same page.
-   A simple copyright line with the current year generated dynamically
